WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.588
Module 4: operating and
evidencing the fleet.

2
00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:09.050
Once the GPOs are gone, a device's state
is no longer explained by where it sits.

3
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:14.200
It has to be proved, continuously, from
records the services already keep.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.785
The run state replaces the OU
answer with three records:

5
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:22.462
the policy library from Chapter 08,
which says what each device should be;

6
00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:25.658
the status Intune and
Defender report per device,

7
00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:29.087
which says what it is; and
the audit log of every change.

8
00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:32.750
Operating the fleet means
keeping those three in agreement.

9
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.135
Evidencing it means handing
an assessor the same records,

10
00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:38.300
not a document written for the audit.
